# Never publish these from this repo.
# The CV PDF carries a phone number and address. WARNING: this line alone does
# nothing today -- the file is already tracked (since a7e0898) and ignore rules
# never apply to tracked files. It has to be untracked first:
#   git rm --cached assets/Pham-Quang-Dung-CV.pdf
# and the blob still has to be purged from history with git filter-repo, the
# same purge Landing-Bio needs. No page in this repo links the file.
assets/Pham-Quang-Dung-CV.pdf

# Design references pulled off other people's work. Fine to look at locally,
# not ours to redistribute in a public repo.
assets/dribbble_menu.png
assets/reference_menu.png

# Bản gốc từ newversion.zip, giữ lại để đối chiếu khi làm việc.
